        "name": "reparent_task",
        "description": "Move a task under another container (parent_id) or to the root (root=true). Ids never change. In hierarchical projects the move is an integration hierarchy mutation: live, owned or code-carrying work answers needs_quiescence with its owner and safe continuation, and the optional expected_*_generation fences refuse a stale parent.",
